  ggen:inputContract "ggen.toml text; same table names ([project],[ontology],[packs],[templates],[law]) but genuinely divergent shapes ([[packs]] array-of-tables of flat PackRef vs. [packs] table-of-tables of an untagged enum PackRef)" ;
